From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bonsai-27b-fusion <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs(fusion): give this worktree its first ledger

The PrismML fusion had no fusion/ directory, so it had no provenance record at
all: not what it was forked from, not what had been ported, not what had been
verified. state.json and upstream-sync-log.md now carry that, reconstructed from
the repository plus the audit run today.

The headline entries are the audit result (the fusion was a type/kernel half with
no integration, so --cache-type-k turbo3 was rejected) and the measurement that
came out of verifying the fix: quantized KV with flash attention is broken at
head_dim 128 - for q8_0 as much as for turbo3 - and works at head_dim 256, which
is what every production model here uses.
